This repository is a user fork and substantial adaptation of the upstream project
quantskills/skill-pandaai-factor-online.

The current codebase is a pure factors_lab factor-mining skill. It retains no
third-party factor-platform integration, account/login workflow, remote factor
creation, remote backtest, platform field/operator contract, or platform-specific
export path.

The adapted version is specialized for:
  jingyunzhang1110/factors_lab

Major changes include a bundled 549-factor mother-bank snapshot, factors_lab
canonical-AST output, strict field/operator compatibility checks, future-information
guards, exact and rank-equivalent deduplication, and parameter-variant diversity
controls.

